{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><img src=\"https://d1x4njjgkw4jf2.cloudfront.net/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-260509-07.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:1em\">\n<p>【Now新聞台】本港今日(5月9日)天氣預測，大致多雲，有幾陣驟雨，天氣稍涼，日間最高氣溫約25度，吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p>\n<p>展望明早仍然稍涼，隨後兩三日短暫時間有陽光，日間炎熱。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T23:48:02.770971+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none"}}